  "card_set": "BOOSTER DIMENSIONAL PHASE [BT11]",
  "card_text": "When you would play this card, you can also place cards from your trash in digivolution cards for a DigiXros.<br>[On Play][When Digivolving] You may play 1 purple level 4 or lower Digimon card or 1 level 4 or lower Digimon card with [Xros Heart] in its traits from your trash without paying the cost. If DigiXrosing, add 1 to the number of cards you play with this effect.<br>[All Turns] All of your Digimon with [Xros Heart] in their traits or with &lt;Retaliation&gt; gain &lt;Rush&gt; and &lt;Blocker&gt;.<br>DigiXros -3: 1 Digimon card w/[Xros Heart] in traits<br>When you would play this card, you may place specified cards from your hand/battle area under it. Each placed card reduces the play cost.",
